  "description": "Upgrade your vehicle's interior with OEDRO floor liners, designed specifically for the 2022-2026 Hyundai Tucson (non-Hybrid) with a standard audio system. These durable, easy-to-clean liners provide ultimate protection against dirt, spills, and stains, ensuring your car stays spotless. Crafted to fit perfectly, they won’t shed or accumulate grime, keeping your interior fresh and clean. Experience top-tier quality and a sleek look while safeguarding your car’s flooring with OEDRO’s floor liners—your vehicle deserves the best!\nFeatures\nDurability: OEDRO floor mats are made from premium, strong rubber, ensuring long-lasting performance compared to other mats. Their flexibility and heavy-duty construction can withstand constant foot traffic and friction from shoes, offering lasting protection.\nSleek Aesthetic: Add a touch of sophistication to your vehicle with OEDRO floor mats. Their stylish all-weather design not only enhances the interior's appearance but also adds a vibrant, classy touch to your car.\nSuperior Interior Protection: OEDRO floor mats provide unparalleled protection for your car's interior. They shield your carpets from dirt, water, and spills, keeping the interior clean and dry in all conditions.\nEffortless Cleaning: OEDRO floor mats are designed for easy maintenance. Simply rinse them with soap and water to remove dirt or spills. After drying, the mats are odor-free and ready for use again.\nEffective Dirt and Moisture Trapping: The waterproof surface of OEDRO floor mats effectively traps liquids, dust, sand, and other debris. This ensures your vehicle's interior stays spotless and dry, even in harsh weather conditions.\n2-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
